        "official_en_sha256": "317705f2fb5991bd5f4d233c3789d737472e92b58383f7a886a6bd214971cf42"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ナンバーワンが二人いてもいい。\r\n俺とお前はそれぞれが最強になる……。",
        "official_en": "We can both be the greatest. We can both be the best in our own way.",
