        "official_en_sha256": "4fe39d5ae2d92525fecc2b5535c0355565894c3086e7ec2d79eb5c440a85e075"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今考えれば、子供じみた約束だったな。\r\nナンバーワンは二人じゃなれないのに。",
        "official_en": "It was a rather childish promise to make, now that I think of it. How can two people be the greatest?",
        "real_en": null
      },
