        "official_en_sha256": "9e6f89d9438bb52c9048b8699f8373627d33bf99af8389be157dd5c245a13eae"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺たちが剣と刀で、それぞれ道を極めれば\r\nナンバーワンは二人ってことになるんじゃないか？",
        "official_en": "If we both master our weapons—great sword and katana—couldn’t we both be the greatest at each of them?",
        "real_en": "If we each master our own weapon, sword and katana, couldn't we both be number one?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
